1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,920
You can keep more than one account in ActTrader and switch between them.

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:09,780
Click the logo to see your accounts. The tick shows the one you are using.

3
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:13,000
Add new account opens a login form.

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:17,860
Pick the server, then enter that account's login and password.

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:22,220
Click Login. The account is checked, then added to your list.

6
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:26,030
We will cancel here.

7
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:30,390
Once added, open this menu and click an account to switch to it.

8
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:33,890
Each account keeps its own watchlists, layout and strategies.

